.TH MYSTRNCPY 3 "2026-09-23" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
mystrncpy \- copy at most n characters of a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include "mystrfunctions.h"

int mystrncpy(char* dest, const char* src, int n);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Copies at most n characters from src to dest. If src is shorter than n, the rest of dest is filled with null bytes. If src has n or more characters, dest is not null-terminated. Returns the number of characters copied from src.
